column9:
Based on the below CSS code, the color of the background of the web page
is white.
<style type = “text/css>
Body {background-color: blue;}
P {color: yellow;}
</style>

Perform the following example and view the output:
<HTML>
<HEAD>
<STYLE>
H1{
Color: Red;
Text-align: Center}
H2{
Color: Blue}
MARQUEE{
Font-size: 24pt;
Color: red}
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>
<H1> Welcome to the world of CSS</H1><BR><BR>
<H2>This is Inline Style Sheet</H2>
<MARQUEE>NICE</MARQUEE>
</BODY>
</HTML>
